## Known Issues (do not "fix" without discussion)

- DevPanel console component not found in regression test (GUI test)
- Knob sensitivity / SmoothedSlider 1px drift (partially addressed)
- Code signing blocked on DUNS number (C4)
- Alt+click 1px drift, color slider glitch, dev button misalignment,
  pyramid centering — logged but low priority
- Resizable GUI — high priority, not yet implemented

---

## When in Doubt

If your commit message needs a `WIP:` prefix, that's honest. Ship it.
If you're unsure whether a finding is actually fixed, re-read the code
one more time. The most dangerous commits are the ones where the message
says "fixed" but the code says otherwise.
